It's okay.

495
01:42:34.146 --> 01:42:42.146
So it's important that you stand by each other and that you give each other those promises,

496
01:42:42.146 --> 01:42:50.146
so that in the testimony of the people who are present, and the testimony of God Himself, even more importantly,

497
01:42:50.146 --> 01:42:52.146
