501
01:43:04.146 --> 01:43:08.146
When Israel went wrong, and when they sinned against God,

502
01:43:08.146 --> 01:43:11.146
God reminds Himself every time,

503
01:43:11.146 --> 01:43:17.146
hey listen, I have married you, I have made a contract, a covenant with you,

504
01:43:17.146 --> 01:43:19.146
and I hold to my Word.

505
01:43:19.146 --> 01:43:21.146
God is trustworthy.

506
01:43:21.146 --> 01:43:22.146
He is love.

507
01:43:22.146 --> 01:43:25.146
He will never truly separate from us.

508
01:43:25.146 --> 01:43:27.146
He will never leave us.

509
01:43:27.146 --> 01:43:31.146
These are all the texts that should echo in our marriages.

510
01:43:31.146 --> 01:43:34.146
That is why we also ask at the altar, when you marry,

511
01:43:34.146 --> 01:43:40.146
