513
01:43:45.146 --> 01:43:50.146
Do you promise that you will be there for each other, in good times and in difficult times,

514
01:43:50.146 --> 01:43:55.146
as God is always there for you, in wonderful times Marijs, even in your deep valley.

515
01:43:55.146 --> 01:44:01.146
And so we must make an agreement with each other, make a covenant with each other,

516
01:44:01.146 --> 01:44:04.146
and the covenant that Vanessa and I have with each other,

517
01:44:04.146 --> 01:44:09.146
is a covenant that strongly resembles and reflects, as Paul says,

518
01:44:09.146 --> 01:44:17.146
it is like a covenant between Vanessa and Tim, is like a covenant between Jesus and the people.

519
01:44:17.146 --> 01:44:22.146
