521
01:44:28.146 --> 01:44:30.146
in good times and in difficult days.

522
01:44:30.146 --> 01:44:34.146
Here are people who will not leave each other, who will not go astray,

523
01:44:34.146 --> 01:44:36.146
and so on, and so forth.

524
01:44:36.146 --> 01:44:41.146
And that is how we will reflect the love of God to the people.

525
01:44:41.146 --> 01:44:44.146
And that is why it is important, during this first sermon,

526
01:44:44.146 --> 01:44:47.146
